    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbSimple and fun action-packed runner game!</strong></h2> An exhilarating runner game featuring everyone's favorite &quot;Crayon Shin-chan&quot;!<br> Jump past obstacles, collecting sweets and &quot;golden balls&quot; along the way.<br> Easy-to-use controls mean anyone can jump right in!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbFull of Shin-chan's costumes and reliable crew!</strong></h2> Use the &quot;golden balls&quot; and &quot;medals&quot; earned in-game to collect Shin-chan's costumes from the animated series and movies along with picking up crew along the way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u30fbHone your skills and continue challenging!</strong></h2> Not stopping at just clearing a stage, you can continue having fun by aiming for the high score and completing goals, obtaining all the costumes, and gathering the entire crew.",
